    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marble Meadows is a bright and colorful homage to classic marble platformers. Explore a cozy cottage home filled with daring jumps and shaking surfaces. Zip around teacups and bounce off house plants in courses full of rewarding challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818680/extras/0261a745ce098ae0443969eefcfe2fd9.avif?t=1729481230\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818680/extras/4c53597f7b648dabf3fee9e468262526.avif?t=1729481230\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re so glad to see you on this side of the forest! Welcome to the Marble Meadows, home to a quiet cottage tucked away from the world. Roll your marble through the house\u2019s sprawling solarium, or up and across the homely kitchen tables. There\u2019s much to enjoy in our corner of the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818680/extras/55321217347a2953e0302bc1437e7af1.avif?t=1729481230\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818680/extras/d0592f2ab802b8709200d4b945997d70.avif?t=1729481230\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every spot in the cottage is quite so easy to get to! You'll need to use your surroundings if you want to get ahead. With handy checkpoints along the way, you can take your time making the perfect jump to land exactly where you need to!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818680/extras/9ccc59043d8b1b3109c4825faca9dc68.avif?t=1729481230\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818680/extras/8cc942aa1ab842660da6bfc231c7c20e.avif?t=1729481230\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you just want a break from the hustle and bustle of the real world, feel free to explore the cottage or the rest of the meadows. The skies are clear and the shade is nice and cool. Roll your marble around to view the sights and relax in the garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818680/extras/43dd7a5a00235756ac1ad8f2a62cf29f.avif?t=1729481230\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818680/extras/12463c61fe52f2c3138a57352c4088ae.avif?t=1729481230\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to try something exciting? Use power ups or play special stages to complete gravity-defying feats! Whether you're launching yourself with the power of magnets or blasting through a time trial, there's certainly more to do in the meadows than just rolling around.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818680/extras/734975680cc89e374268763e268cf1fb.avif?t=1729481230\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818680/extras/07f827023662b171e2252b0be081718d.avif?t=1729481230\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you someone who\u2019s aiming for the full 100%? Complete quests all across the meadow in order to gain Steam Achievements. And if you\u2019re clever enough, discover the 5 hidden achievements collected by only the most discerning of players.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marble Meadows is a bright and colorful homage to classic marble platformers. Explore a cozy cottage home filled with daring jumps and shaking surfaces. Zip around teacups and bounce off house plants in courses full of rewarding challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818680/extras/0261a745ce098ae0443969eefcfe2fd9.avif?t=1729481230\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818680/extras/4c53597f7b648dabf3fee9e468262526.avif?t=1729481230\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re so glad to see you on this side of the forest! Welcome to the Marble Meadows, home to a quiet cottage tucked away from the world. Roll your marble through the house\u2019s sprawling solarium, or up and across the homely kitchen tables. There\u2019s much to enjoy in our corner of the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818680/extras/55321217347a2953e0302bc1437e7af1.avif?t=1729481230\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818680/extras/d0592f2ab802b8709200d4b945997d70.avif?t=1729481230\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every spot in the cottage is quite so easy to get to! You'll need to use your surroundings if you want to get ahead. With handy checkpoints along the way, you can take your time making the perfect jump to land exactly where you need to!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818680/extras/9ccc59043d8b1b3109c4825faca9dc68.avif?t=1729481230\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818680/extras/8cc942aa1ab842660da6bfc231c7c20e.avif?t=1729481230\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you just want a break from the hustle and bustle of the real world, feel free to explore the cottage or the rest of the meadows. The skies are clear and the shade is nice and cool. Roll your marble around to view the sights and relax in the garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818680/extras/43dd7a5a00235756ac1ad8f2a62cf29f.avif?t=1729481230\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818680/extras/12463c61fe52f2c3138a57352c4088ae.avif?t=1729481230\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to try something exciting? Use power ups or play special stages to complete gravity-defying feats! Whether you're launching yourself with the power of magnets or blasting through a time trial, there's certainly more to do in the meadows than just rolling around.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818680/extras/734975680cc89e374268763e268cf1fb.avif?t=1729481230\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818680/extras/07f827023662b171e2252b0be081718d.avif?t=1729481230\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you someone who\u2019s aiming for the full 100%? Complete quests all across the meadow in order to gain Steam Achievements. And if you\u2019re clever enough, discover the 5 hidden achievements collected by only the most discerning of players.</p>",
